# BUZZBOLT: wave 5 is nothing but the last boss, the Sporeheart, with a
# gnat that keeps pestering the ship (shot down, another comes back). It
# can be beaten, and the ending follows. Flown by the demo player in the
# firefly.
game buzzbolt
press A
wait 10
press LEFT
press A
wait 10
cheat lives 3
cheat wave 5
waituntil boss_count == 1 300
expect boss_kind == 14
expect foes == 1
waituntil pests == 1 300
botuntil kills >= 1 3000
expect pests == 0
waituntil pests == 1 400
botuntil boss_dead == 1 12000
expect boss_count == 0
waituntil state == 4 400
expect wave == 5
waituntil state == 6 400
expect won == 1
